        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1407-630 2-1/2\" Concave Stainless Steel Door Bumper</b>\r\n<p>\r\nLarge round 2-1/2\" wall mounted stainless steel door bumper (door stop) is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. \r\nThe rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. \r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1407_size.gif?v=1704354654\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1407-630 2-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Door Bumper Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-inch-stainless-steel-door-bumper-don-jo-1406-630\"><b>2-1/2\" Convex Stainless Steel Door Bumper</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese stainless steel wall mounted door bumpers are  used everywhere  from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. Anywhere you need to prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo 1407-630 2-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Door Bumper\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Housing Material: Wrought</li>\r\n<li>Concave Rubber Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Color: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #8 x 1-1/4\" Sheet Metal Screw, Plastic Anchor and Plastic Cement Anchor</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1407.pdf?v=1704262299\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1407  Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
